an data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"22\">and</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"23\">(1</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"24\">-</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"25\">f)</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"26\">for</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"27\">every</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"28\">example</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"29\">with</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"30\">y</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"31\">=</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"32\">0.</span> <span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"0\">The</span> <span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"1\">best</span> <span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"2\">parameters</span> <span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"3\">make</span> <span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"4\">that</span> <span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"5\">product</span> <span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"6\">as</span> <span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"7\">large</span> <span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"8\">as</span> <span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"9\">possible.</span> <span data-s=\"32\" data-w=\"0\">A</span> <span data-s=\"32\" data-w=\"1\">product</span> <span data-s=\"32\" data-w=\"2\">of</span> <span data-s=\"32\" data-w=\"3\">many</span> <span data-s=\"32\" data-w=\"4\">small</span> <span data-s=\"32\" data-w=\"5\">numbers</span> <span data-s=\"32\" data-w=\"6\">is</span> <span data-s=\"32\" data-w=\"7\">awkward,</span> <span data-s=\"32\" data-w=\"8\">so</span> <span data-s=\"32\" data-w=\"9\">take</span> <span data-s=\"32\" data-w=\"10\">the</span> <span data-s=\"32\" data-w=\"11\">logarithm,</span> <span data-s=\"32\" data-w=\"12\">which</span> <span data-s=\"32\" data-w=\"13\">turns</span> <span data-s=\"32\" data-w=\"14\">it</span> <span data-s=\"32\" data-w=\"15\">into</span> <span data-s=\"32\" data-w=\"16\">a</span> <span data-s=\"32\" data-w=\"17\">sum,</span> <span data-s=\"32\" data-w=\"18\">and</span> <span data-s=\"32\" data-w=\"19\">flip</span> <span data-s=\"32\" data-w=\"20\">the</span> <span data-s=\"32\" data-w=\"21\">sign</span> <span data-s=\"32\" data-w=\"22\">so</span> <span data-s=\"32\" data-w=\"23\">that</span> <span data-s=\"32\" data-w=\"24\">\"largest</span> <span data-s=\"32\" data-w=\"25\">likelihood\"</span> <span data-s=\"32\" data-w=\"26\">becomes</span> <span data-s=\"32\" data-w=\"27\">\"smallest</span> <span data-s=\"32\" data-w=\"28\">cost\".</span> <span data-s=\"33\" data-w=\"0\">The</span> <span data-s=\"33\" data-w=\"1\">result</span> <span data-s=\"33\" data-w=\"2\">is</span> <span data-s=\"33\" data-w=\"3\">the</span> <span data-s=\"33\" data-w=\"4\">cost</span> <span data-s=\"33\" data-w=\"5\">above.</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"0\">So</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"1\">it</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"2\">is</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"3\">not</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"4\">an</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"5\">arbitrary</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"6\">choice:</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"7\">it</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"8\">is</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"9\">the</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"10\">principle</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"11\">of</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"12\">making</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"13\">the</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"14\">observed</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"15\">data</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"16\">as</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"17\">probable</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"18\">as</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"19\">possible.</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"h-104-the-gradient\"><span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"0\">10.4</span> <span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"1\">The</span> <span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"2\">gradient</span></h4>\n<div class=\"math\"><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>:</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>m</mi></mfrac><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></munderover><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>w</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace><mi>b</mi><mo>:</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>m</mi></mfrac><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></munderover><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>w</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>x</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_j := w_j - \\alpha \\frac{1}{m} \\sum_{i=1}^{m} \\left( f_{\\vec{w},b}(\\vec{x}^{(i)}) - y^{(i)} \\right) x_j^{(i)} \\qquad b := b - \\alpha \\frac{1}{m} \\sum_{i=1}^{m} \\left( f_{\\vec{w},b}(\\vec{x}^{(i)}) - y^{(i)} \\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span></div>\n<p><span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"0\">This</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"1\">looks</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"2\">exactly</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"3\">like</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"4\">the</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"5\">linear</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"6\">regression</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"7\">update</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"8\">from</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"9\">Chapter</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"10\">7,</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"11\">and</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"12\">Ng</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"13\">points</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"14\">out</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"15\">how</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"16\">surprising</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"17\">that</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"18\">is.</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"0\">The</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"1\">difference</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"2\">is</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"3\">hidden</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"4\">inside</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"5\">f:</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"6\">for</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"7\">linear</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"8\">regression</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"9\">it</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"10\">is</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"11\">w</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"12\">.</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"13\">x</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"14\">+</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"15\">b,</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"16\">and</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"17\">here</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"18\">it</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"19\">is</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"20\">the</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"21\">sigmoid</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"22\">of</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"23\">w</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"24\">.</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"25\">x</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"26\">+</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"27\">b</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"28\">(Ng,</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"29\">video</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"30\">36).</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"0\">It</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"1\">is</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"2\">not</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"3\">a</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"4\">coincidence:</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"5\">both</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"6\">come</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"7\">from</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"8\">the</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"9\">same</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"10\">family</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"11\">of</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"12\">models</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"13\">(generalized</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"14\">linear</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"15\">models),</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"16\">and</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"17\">the</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"18\">cost</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"19\">was</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"20\">designed</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"21\">that</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"22\">way.</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"h-105-code-from-scratch-checked-against-scikit-learn\"><span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"0\">10.5</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"1\">Code</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"2\">from</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"3\">scratch,</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"4\">checked</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"5\">against</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"6\">scikit-learn</span></h4>\n<pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\nfrom sklearn.linear_model import LogisticRegression\n\ndef sigmoid(z):\n    return 1 / (1 + np.exp(-z))\n\ndef cost(w, b, X, y):\n    f = sigmoid(X @ w + b)\n    return -np.mean(y * np.log(f) + (1 - y) * np.log(1 - f))\n\ndef fit(X, y, alpha=0.5, steps=5000):\n    m, n = X.shape\n    w, b = np.zeros(n), 0.0\n    for _ in range(steps):\n        err = sigmoid(X @ w + b) - y            # prediction minus target\n        w = w - alpha * (X.T @ err) / m\n        b = b - alpha * err.mean()\n    return w, b\n\nrng = np.random.default_rng(2)\nX = rng.normal(size=(400, 2))                              # two features, already on similar scales\ny = (X[:, 0] + X[:, 1] + rng.normal(0, 0.7, 400) &gt; 0.5).astype(float)\n\nprint(round(cost(np.zeros(2), 0.0, X, y), 3))              # 0.693\nw, b = fit(X, y)\nprint(np.round(w, 3), round(b, 3))                         # [2.617 2.412] -1.063\nsk = LogisticRegression(C=np.inf, tol=1e-10, max_iter=10000).fit(X, y)   # C=inf means no regularization\nprint(np.round(sk.coef_[0], 3), np.round(sk.intercept_[0], 3))          # [2.617 2.412] -1.063\npred = sigmoid(X @ w + b) &gt;= 0.5\nprint(round((pred == y).mean(), 3), round(max(y.mean(), 1 - y.mean()), 3))   # 0.862 0.62  accuracy vs baseline\n</code></pre>\n<p><span data-s=\"40\" data-w=\"0\">The</span> <span data-s=\"40\" data-w=\"1\">handmade</span> <span data-s=\"40\" data-w=\"2\">model</span> <span data-s=\"40\" data-w=\"3\">and</span> <span data-s=\"40\" data-w=\"4\">scikit-learn</span> <span data-s=\"40\" data-w=\"5\">agree</span> <span data-s=\"40\" data-w=\"6\">to</span> <span data-s=\"40\" data-w=\"7\">three</span> <span data-s=\"40\" data-w=\"8\">decimals.</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"0\">The</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"1\">model</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"2\">gets</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"3\">86.2%</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"4\">right</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"5\">against</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"6\">a</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"7\">baseline</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"8\">of</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"9\">62%</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"10\">(always</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"11\">guessing</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"12\">the</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"13\">majority</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"14\">class).</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"0\">That</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"1\">is</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"2\">the</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"3\">comparison</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"4\">to</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"5\">make</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"6\">every</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"7\">time</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"8\">(Chapter</span> <span data-s=\"42\" data-w=\"9\">3).</span> <span data-s=\"43\" data-w=\"0\">Note</span> <span data-s=\"43\" data-w=\"1\">that</span> <span data-s=\"43\" data-w=\"2\">this</span> <span data-s=\"43\" data-w=\"3\">accuracy</span> <span data-s=\"43\" data-w=\"4\">is</span> <span data-s=\"43\" data-w=\"5\">on</span> <span data-s=\"43\" data-w=\"6\">the</span> <span data-s=\"43\" data-w=\"7\">training</span> <span data-s=\"43\" data-w=\"8\">data.</span> <span data-s=\"44\" data-w=\"0\">A</span> <span data-s=\"44\" data-w=\"1\">fair</span> <span data-s=\"44\" data-w=\"2\">score</span> <span data-s=\"44\" data-w=\"3\">needs</span> <span data-s=\"44\" data-w=\"4\">held-out</span> <span data-s=\"44\" data-w=\"5\">data.</span></p>\n<h4 id=\"h-106-in-practice\"><span data-s=\"45\" data-w=\"0\">10.6</span> <span data-s=\"45\" data-w=\"1\">In</span> <span data-s=\"45\" data-w=\"2\">practice</span></h4>\n<ul>\n<li><span data-s=\"46\" data-w=\"0\">Scale</span> <span data-s=\"46\" data-w=\"1\">the</span> <span data-s=\"46\" data-w=\"2\">features</span> <span data-s=\"46\" data-w=\"3\">first</span> <span data-s=\"46\" data-w=\"4\">(Chapter</span> <span data-s=\"46\" data-w=\"5\">8),</span> <span data-s=\"46\" data-w=\"6\">or</span> <span data-s=\"46\" data-w=\"7\">gradient</span> <span data-s=\"46\" data-w=\"8\">descent</span> <span data-s=\"46\" data-w=\"9\">will</span> <span data-s=\"46\" data-w=\"10\">crawl.</span></li>\n<li><span data-s=\"47\" data-w=\"0\">If</span> <span data-s=\"47\" data-w=\"1\">one</span> <span data-s=\"47\" data-w=\"2\">class</span> <span data-s=\"47\" data-w=\"3\">is</span> <span data-s=\"47\" data-w=\"4\">rare</span> <span data-s=\"47\" data-w=\"5\">(defaults,</span> <span data-s=\"47\" data-w=\"6\">fraud),</span> <span data-s=\"47\" data-w=\"7\">accuracy</span> <span data-s=\"47\" data-w=\"8\">is</span> <span data-s=\"47\" data-w=\"9\">a</span> <span data-s=\"47\" data-w=\"10\">poor</span> <span data-s=\"47\" data-w=\"11\">yardstick;</span> <span data-s=\"47\" data-w=\"12\">read</span> <span data-s=\"47\" data-w=\"13\">Chapter</span> <span data-s=\"47\" data-w=\"14\">12.</span></li>\n<li><span data-s=\"48\" data-w=\"0\">Add</span> <span data-s=\"48\" data-w=\"1\">regularization</span> <span data-s=\"48\" data-w=\"2\">when</span> <span data-s=\"48\" data-w=\"3\">you</span> <span data-s=\"48\" data-w=\"4\">have</span> <span data-s=\"48\" data-w=\"5\">many</span> <span data-s=\"48\" data-w=\"6\">features</span> <span data-s=\"48\" data-w=\"7\">or</span> <span data-s=\"48\" data-w=\"8\">little</span> <span data-s=\"48\" data-w=\"9\">data</span> <span data-s=\"48\" data-w=\"10\">(Chapter</span> <span data-s=\"48\" data-w=\"11\">11).</span></li>\n<li><span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"0\">scikit-learn's</span> <code><span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"1\">LogisticRegression</span></code> <span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"2\">has</span> <span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"3\">regularization</span> <span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"4\">on</span> <span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"5\">by</span> <span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"6\">default,</span> <span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"7\">with</span> <span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"8\">strength</span> <code><span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"9\">C</span></code><span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"9\">,</span> <span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"10\">where</span> <span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"11\">C</span> <span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"12\">is</span> <span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"13\">1</span> <span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"14\">divided</span> <span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"15\">by</span> <span data-s=\"49\" data-w=\"16\">lambda.</span> <span data-s=\"50\" data-w=\"0\">For</span> <span data-s=\"50\" data-w=\"1\">an</span> <span data-s=\"50\" data-w=\"2\">unregularized</span> <span data-s=\"50\" data-w=\"3\">fit,</span> <span data-s=\"50\" data-w=\"4\">as</span> <span data-s=\"50\" data-w=\"5\">above,</span> <span data-s=\"50\" data-w=\"6\">pass</span> <code><span data-s=\"50\" data-w=\"7\">C=np.inf</span></code><span data-s=\"50\" data-w=\"7\">.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span data-s=\"51\" data-w=\"0\">Loan</span> <span data-s=\"51\" data-w=\"1\">example.</span></strong> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"0\">Train</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"1\">a</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"2\">classifier</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"3\">on</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"4\">the</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"5\">offers</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"6\">table</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"7\">with</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"8\">label</span> <span data-s=\"52\" data-w=\"9\">Accepted.</span> <span data-s=\"53\" data-w=\"0\">Hold</span> <span data-s=\"53\" data-w=\"1\">out</span> <span data-s=\"53\" data-w=\"2\">20%</span> <span data-s=\"53\" data-w=\"3\">of</span> <span data-s=\"53\" data-w=\"4\">the</span> <span data-s=\"53\" data-w=\"5\">rows,</span> <span data-s=\"53\" data-w=\"6\">scale</span> <span data-s=\"53\" data-w=\"7\">with</span> <span data-s=\"53\" data-w=\"8\">the</span> <span data-s=\"53\" data-w=\"9\">training</span> <span data-s=\"53\" data-w=\"10\">mean</span> <span data-s=\"53\" data-w=\"11\">and</span> <span data-s=\"53\" data-w=\"12\">standard</span> <span data-s=\"53\" data-w=\"13\">deviation,</span> <span data-s=\"53\" data-w=\"14\">fit</span> <span data-s=\"53\" data-w=\"15\">your</span> <span data-s=\"53\" data-w=\"16\">own</span> <span data-s=\"53\" data-w=\"17\">function</span> <span data-s=\"53\" data-w=\"18\">and</span> <span data-s=\"53\" data-w=\"19\">scikit-learn</span> <span data-s=\"53\" data-w=\"20\">on</span> <span data-s=\"53\" data-w=\"21\">the</span> <span data-s=\"53\" data-w=\"22\">same</span> <span data-s=\"53\" data-w=\"23\">scaled</span> <span data-s=\"53\" data-w=\"24\">features,</span> <span data-s=\"53\" data-w=\"25\">and</span> <span data-s=\"53\" data-w=\"26\">check</span> <span data-s=\"53\" data-w=\"27\">that</span> <span data-s=\"53\" data-w=\"28\">the</span> <span data-s=\"53\" data-w=\"29\">weights</span> <span data-s=\"53\" data-w=\"30\">agree.</span> <span data-s=\"54\" data-w=\"0\">Then</span> <span data-s=\"54\" data-w=\"1\">compare</span> <span data-s=\"54\" data-w=\"2\">the</span> <span data-s=\"54\" data-w=\"3\">held-out</span> <span data-s=\"54\" data-w=\"4\">accuracy</span> <span data-s=\"54\" data-w=\"5\">with</span> <span data-s=\"54\" data-w=\"6\">the</span> <span data-s=\"54\" data-w=\"7\">baseline</span> <span data-s=\"54\" data-w=\"8\">of</span> <span data-s=\"54\" data-w=\"9\">predicting</span> <span data-s=\"54\" data-w=\"10\">the</span> <span data-s=\"54\" data-w=\"11\">most</span> <span data-s=\"54\" data-w=\"12\">common</span> <span data-s=\"54\" data-w=\"13\">outcome.</span> <span data-s=\"55\" data-w=\"0\">This</span> <span data-s=\"55\" data-w=\"1\">is</span> <span data-s=\"55\" data-w=\"2\">exactly</span> <span data-s=\"55\" data-w=\"3\">the</span> <span data-s=\"55\" data-w=\"4\">Wednesday</span> <span data-s=\"55\" data-w=\"5\">drill</span> <span data-s=\"55\" data-w=\"6\">of</span> <span data-s=\"55\" data-w=\"7\">week</span> <span data-s=\"55\" data-w=\"8\">3.</span></p>\n<p><strong><span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"0\">Common</span> <span data-s=\"56\" data-w=\"1\">mistakes</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"0\">Using</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"1\">squared</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"2\">error</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"3\">as</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"4\">the</span> <span data-s=\"57\" data-w=\"5\">cost.</span></li>\n<li><span data-s=\"58\" data-w=\"0\">Writing</span> <span data-s=\"58\" data-w=\"1\">log(0):</span> <span data-s=\"58\" data-w=\"2\">if</span> <span data-s=\"58\" data-w=\"3\">a</span> <span data-s=\"58\" data-w=\"4\">prediction</span> <span data-s=\"58\" data-w=\"5\">is</span> <span data-s=\"58\" data-w=\"6\">exactly</span> <span data-s=\"58\" data-w=\"7\">0</span> <span data-s=\"58\" data-w=\"8\">or</span> <span data-s=\"58\" data-w=\"9\">1</span> <span data-s=\"58\" data-w=\"10\">and</span> <span data-s=\"58\" data-w=\"11\">wrong,</span> <span data-s=\"58\" data-w=\"12\">the</span> <span data-s=\"58\" data-w=\"13\">loss</span> <span data-s=\"58\" data-w=\"14\">is</span> <span data-s=\"58\" data-w=\"15\">infinite.</span> <span data-s=\"59\" data-w=\"0\">Libraries</span> <span data-s=\"59\" data-w=\"1\">clip</span> <span data-s=\"59\" data-w=\"2\">the</span> <span data-s=\"59\" data-w=\"3\">values</span> <span data-s=\"59\" data-w=\"4\">slightly</span> <span data-s=\"59\" data-w=\"5\">away</span> <span data-s=\"59\" data-w=\"6\">from</span> <span data-s=\"59\" data-w=\"7\">0</span> <span data-s=\"59\" data-w=\"8\">and</span> <span data-s=\"59\" data-w=\"9\">1.</span></li>\n<li><span data-s=\"60\" data-w=\"0\">Reporting</span> <span data-s=\"60\" data-w=\"1\">training</span> <span data-s=\"60\" data-w=\"2\">accuracy</span> <span data-s=\"60\" data-w=\"3\">as</span> <span data-s=\"60\" data-w=\"4\">if</span> <span data-s=\"60\" data-w=\"5\">it</span> <span data-s=\"60\" data-w=\"6\">were</span> <span data-s=\"60\" data-w=\"7\">the</span> <span data-s=\"60\" data-w=\"8\">real</span> <span data-s=\"60\" data-w=\"9\">score.</span></li>\n<li><span data-s=\"61\" data-w=\"0\">Comparing</span> <span data-s=\"61\" data-w=\"1\">your</span> <span data-s=\"61\" data-w=\"2\">weights</span> <span data-s=\"61\" data-w=\"3\">with</span> <span data-s=\"61\" data-w=\"4\">scikit-learn's</span> <span data-s=\"61\" data-w=\"5\">without</span> <span data-s=\"61\" data-w=\"6\">setting</span> <span data-s=\"61\" data-w=\"7\">the</span> <span data-s=\"61\" data-w=\"8\">same</span> <span data-s=\"61\" data-w=\"9\">regularization.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Check yourself</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Compute the loss for y = 1 when f = 0.8, and for y = 0 when f = 0.8.</li>\n<li>Why is the cost exactly 0.693 at w = 0, b = 0?</li>\n<li>What changes between the gradient for linear and logistic regression?</li>\n<li>Why does log loss punish a confident wrong answer so hard, and is that desirable?</li>\n</ul>\n<details class=\"answers\"><summary>Show answers</summary><p> (1) -ln(0.8) = 0.223 and -ln(0.2) = 1.609. (2) Every prediction is 0.5, and -ln(0.5) = 0.693 for either label. (3) Only the prediction f: a sigmoid in the logistic case. (4) The loss grows without limit as a wrong prediction approaches certainty. That is desirable, because it pushes the model to be calibrated: do not claim certainty you do not have.</p></details>\n<p><strong>Go deeper:</strong> Ng, course 1, videos 34 to 36 · StatQuest, <a class=\"vlink\" href=\"#/watch/BfKanl1aSG0\">Logistic Regression Details Pt 2: Maximum Likelihood</a> · the scikit-learn page on <a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/linear_model.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">linear models</a> (see its logistic regression section for the exact cost it minimizes).</p>\n"}